                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Monsters? We do not make monsters. We have managed to control some of the things the Tritons have fashioned.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Scientist_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Lapona_Olosohpa_AH-WHITE_066.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752283,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Indeed. I marshalled their multi-headed dragons to raise this city, their grand capital, to the surface, beyond their reach.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Scientist_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_Olisihpa_AH-WHITE_035.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1727108,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "But to create a beast ourselves, free of the confines of the Tritons? It is an intriguing notion. Perhaps one day, history will tell of this great feat.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Scientist_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Lapona_Olosohpa_AH-WHITE_067.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752283,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
