  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "AND it was spitting those ghosty things into an Akashic Tear? What does that mean?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Jackalope_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Jaki_Whisperwind_AH-WHITE_112.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It means the nightmares of the monster we created leak into the Akasha, corrupting it, haunting it, infecting the minds who touch it.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_ Khrulhu_Bird_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Avio_of_the_Raven_Clan_AH-WHITE_003.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And if there's a tear in the Akasha, then these Nightmares could be leaking into every other era from here. Eep.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Jackalope_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Jaki_Whisperwind_AH-WHITE_113.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "That is why we must flee this city. The Akasha is strongest here, we cannot evade the slumbering beast. We must go far away where it cannot touch us.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_TreeF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Arbora_of_the_Tree_Clan_AH-WHITE_004.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "No! We must find the creature and slay it, to reclaim the Akasha its mind poisons.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_BugF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Weaver_of_the_Spider_Clan_AH-WHITE_002.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "What kinda creature we talking about here anyway?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Moose_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Tarrak_Hadfield_AH-WHITE_156.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752268,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I... don't know. We controlled many beasts in our prime, but the knowledge of them... is corrupted. Thus we must simply hunt them all!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_BugF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Weaver_of_the_Spider_Clan_AH-WHITE_003.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC02-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
